{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_49508","headline":"思越人 · 鹿虔扆","name":"思越人","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"翠屏欹，银烛背，漏残清夜迢迢。\n双带绣窠盘锦荐，泪侵花暗香销。\n珊瑚枕腻鸦鬟乱，玉纤慵整云散。\n苦是适来新梦见，离肠争不千断。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"鹿虔扆","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_49508.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_49508","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}